# Custom Domain Configuration (Optional)
# If you want to use a custom domain instead of the default CloudFront URL,
# configure the following variables. Both must be provided together.
# If any are missing, the stack will deploy without custom domain support.

# DOMAIN_NAME: The full custom domain name for your application
# Example: DOMAIN_NAME=ghost.chaotictoejam.com
# DOMAIN_NAME=

# HOSTED_ZONE_NAME: The base domain name of your Route 53 hosted zone
# This is typically your root domain (without subdomains)
# The hosted zone ID will be looked up automatically from AWS
# Example: HOSTED_ZONE_NAME=chaotictoejam.com
# HOSTED_ZONE_NAME=